                      ('b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008', -2, 11, 'CONFIRMED', '2a3b4c5d-6e7f-4809-91a2-b3c4d5e6f708', '44444444-4444-4444-8444-000000000001'),
                      -- Bob, unconfirmed. Confirm it within 30 minutes of a boot, or watch the
